{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_mass_grave","model_identifier":"lair_mass_grave","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_mass_grave\n\nLair: mass grave (C6, undead).\n\nA sunken pit of churned earth and bones: a dark trampled floor strewn with bones inside a raised rim of churned earth berms (the pit reads as sunk without cutting the terrain), heaps of earth and bones, skulls, a ribcage, a dropped shovel, and a broken fence of weathered posts around it (some snapped short, rails hanging, missing or fallen). Footprint 10 x 10 terrain columns (160 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -78.0..78.0, y 0.0..30.0, z -86.0..78.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- pit and rim: 140 x 12 x 140 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (walkable over; the fence 154 x 30 x 154 is decoration)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 1, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: centre of the pit floor (the dead claw up out of the heaps).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_mass_grave_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_mass_grave\n\nLair: mass grave (C6, undead).\n\nA sunken pit of churned earth and bones: a dark trampled floor strewn with bones inside a raised rim of churned earth berms (the pit reads as sunk without cutting the terrain), heaps of earth and bones, skulls, a ribcage, a dropped shovel, and a broken fence of weathered posts around it (some snapped short, rails hanging, missing or fallen). Footprint 10 x 10 terrain columns (160 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -78.0..78.0, y 0.0..30.0, z -86.0..78.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- pit and rim: 140 x 12 x 140 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (walkable over; the fence 154 x 30 x 154 is decoration)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 1, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: centre of the pit floor (the dead claw up out of the heaps).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_mass_grave_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pit_floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,0.0,-52.0],"to":[56.0,1.0,52.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,241,132.0,242.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,243,104.0,244.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[132,241,244.0,242.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[104,243,208.0,244.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,112.0,104.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c9d40530-1481-5179-ad47-d1b3369bd7db"},{"name":"rim_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-70.0,0.0,-70.0],"to":[70.0,10.0,-50.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,185,140.0,195.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[140,195,160.0,205.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,195,140.0,205.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[160,195,180.0,205.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[56,104,196.0,124.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8e57f3c2-cce7-5e97-9ea7-d133be6478d5"},{"name":"rim_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_orde